#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:376
msgid "Modifying Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Ändra grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:378
msgid ""
"Many of the graphical elements have internal properties which can be "
"changed. This includes the contents of a particular graph, the association "
"of a widget and the contents of a spreadsheet cell, or the characteristics "
"of a drawing element. These properties can be altered using the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties...</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which"
" appears when the mouse pointer is placed over the graphical element and one"
" of the secondary mouse buttons is clicked. After the context menu appears, "
"clicking on this menu item will open up a dialog allowing the user to alter "
"the properties of the element. Since these properties are specific to each "
"element, these dialogs will be discussed in each of the sections below."
msgstr ""
"Många grafiska element har egenskaper som kan ändras. Det kan till exempel "
"vara innehållet i ett diagram, kopplingen mellan en gränssnittskomponent och"
" en cell eller egenskaperna hos ett teckningselement. Ändra egenskaperna med"
" menyalternativet <guimenuitem>Egenskaper...</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. "
"Öppna snabbmenyn genom att placera muspekaren över elementet och klicka med "
"en sekundär musknapp. När du klickar på menyalternativet öppnas en "
"dialogruta där du kan ändra elementets egenskaper. Eftersom egenskaperna "
"skiljer sig åt mellan olika element beskrivs dialogrutorna i avsnitten "
"nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:397
msgid "Saving Graphical Elements as Images"
msgstr "Spara grafiska element som bilder"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:399
msgid ""
"Some of the graphical elements, the data graphs and the image elements, "
"provide an item in the context menu which allows the element to be saved to "
"a file containing only an image of that element. Graphical plots can be "
"saved in Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG), Portable Network Graphics (PNG) or "
"JPEG formats. Images can be saved to their original format, or to PNG and "
"JPEG formats."
msgstr ""
"Vissa grafiska element, diagram och bildelement, har ett alternativ i "
"snabbmenyn för att spara elementet som en bildfil. Diagram kan sparas i "
"formaten SVG, PNG eller JPEG. Bilder kan sparas i sitt ursprungliga format "
"eller som PNG eller JPEG."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:409
msgid ""
"Elements which can be saved as images can be output to a file using an entry"
" in the element's context menu. First the context menu must be invoked by "
"placing the mouse pointer over the graphical element and clicking with one "
"of the secondary mouse buttons. Next the <guimenuitem>Save as "
"Image</guimenuitem> or the <guimenuitem>Save as</guimenuitem> menu items "
"must be selected by placing the mouse pointer over that item and clicking "
"with the primary mouse pointer. This will open up the <interface>Save "
"As</interface> dialog which will allow the user to name the file which will "
"be created, select where the file will be created, select the file type to "
"use for the image and then generate the file."
msgstr ""
"Du kan spara element som bilder i en fil med ett alternativ i elementets "
"snabbmeny. Öppna snabbmenyn genom att placera muspekaren över det grafiska "
"elementet och klicka med en sekundär musknapp. Välj sedan <guimenuitem>Spara"
" som bild</guimenuitem> eller <guimenuitem>Spara som</guimenuitem> genom att"
" föra pekaren till alternativet och klicka med den primära musknappen. Då "
"öppnas dialogrutan <interface>Spara som</interface>. Där kan du ange filnamn"
" och plats, välja bildformat och skapa filen."
